sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Person
  participant B as Browser playout
  participant G as Gateway
  participant O as Orchestrator
  O->>G: agent audio, generation 3
  G->>B: agent audio, generation 3
  U->>B: starts talking over the agent
  B->>G: mic frames
  G->>O: mic frames
  Note over O: VAD hears speech, echo gate checks it is not the agent's own voice
  O->>O: barge_in: fence = 3, stop LLM and TTS
  O->>G: agent.cancel(3)
  G->>G: purge queued frames with generation 3 or lower
  G->>B: agent.cancel(3)
  B->>B: flush playout queue
  B-->>O: cancel.ack(played_until_seq)
  Note over U,O: silence in median 303 ms, then generation 4 answers the new question
